                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "ICYMI: Last Wednesday, I joined @SenMarkey, @SpfldMACityHall Mayor Sarno, and officials from the @EPA, @MassDEP, and @SpfldWaterSewer for the groundbreaking of the new West Parish Water Treatment Plant.\n\nIt is no coincidence that Springfield's water system is the envy of the nation. This project highlights the continued commitment of federal, state, and local government to invest in the sustainability and resiliency of our region\u2019s infrastructure.\n\nIt is also a stark reminder of our historic legislative achievement in Congress with the Bipartisan Infrastructure Law \u2013 legislation that was drafted in the @WaysMeansCmte under my chairmanship.\n\nhttps://t.co/T7RTQsA0Fk",
